          "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:500;color:#475569;\">1:1 Pixel-perfect AST reproduction · <8KB Vanilla JavaScript · Double-click offline presentation</p>"
        },
        {
