          "type": "text",
          "left": 110,
          "top": 320,
          "width": 372,
          "height": 320,
          "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;\">01. Zero Dependencies</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;color:#2563EB;\">PURE VANILLA WEB STANDARDS</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;line-height:1.7;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#334155;\">No Vue runtime, no Pinia store, no massive npm bundles. Renders standard PPTist geometric AST directly into native SVG and physical DOM elements.</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "s1_card2_bg",
          "type": "shape",
