          "type": "text",
          "left": 582,
          "top": 320,
          "width": 372,
          "height": 320,
          "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;\">02. Double-Click Offline</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;color:#16A34A;\">ZERO SERVER & USB READY</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;line-height:1.7;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#334155;\">Self-contained data inlining completely eradicates Chromium file:/// CORS errors. Carry on a USB flash drive and double-click to present on podiums instantly.</p>"
        },
