          "top": 320,
          "width": 372,
          "height": 320,
          "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;\">03. 1:1 Pixel Fidelity</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;color:#7C3AED;\">SUBPIXEL PRECISION GEOMETRY</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;line-height:1.7;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#334155;\">Adheres strictly to the 1536x864 canvas coordinate space. Hardware-accelerated dynamic scale transforms adapt seamlessly to any projector or screen ratio.</p>"
