          "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#38BDF8;\">Official PPTist Packaging</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0;line-height:1.8;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#CBD5E1;\">• Full Vue3 + Pinia + Vite SPA build (30MB ~ 50MB)<br>• Heavy ProseMirror editor, UI kits & bundle chunks<br>• Fails on file:/// protocol via Chromium CORS policy<br>• Requires local HTTP server installation on podiums</p>"
