          "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#60A5FA;\">PPTist Player (This Project)</p><p style=\"margin:16px 0;line-height:1.8;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#E2E8F0;\">• Zero external dependencies (<8KB standalone JS)<br>• Direct AST-to-physical-DOM geometric compilation<br>• 100% self-contained single-file offline distribution<br>• Instant 0ms boot from USB drive on any computer</p>"
